  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://ibb.co/2gP0Xvx\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://gyazo.com/db087de94fc5316a9e9f94cc26523779\" alt=\"\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Gf2_yROzywY\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>本模組在 1.4.0 及以上版本需安裝 GECKOLIB</strong></span></h2>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">The One Who Watches</span> 是由 <span style=\"color:#0f0\">Pixel</span> <span style=\"color:#a300ff\">Coder</span> 製作的心理恐怖模組</strong></h3>\n<p>未定義</p>\n<p>本模組旨在讓玩家感到極度不安、恐懼，並保持高度警覺。&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">The One Who Watches</span> 是一位會追蹤你的存在，他確實能殺了你，但並非非得如此。有時<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">祂</span>更傾向於折磨你或讓你精神崩潰。<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">祂</span>會讓你以為在<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">祂</span>不在的地方看到了<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">祂</span>。即使<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">祂</span>看起來未必總是具有攻擊性，也絕對不要靠近<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">祂</span>，因為正如我之前所說，<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">祂 </span>真的能殺了你，而且也會這麼做。<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">祂</span>或許會放你逃脫，只是因為<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">祂</span>更喜歡看你驚慌奔逃，而不是讓你的生命這麼快結束。&nbsp;<strong>唯一能避開<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">祂</span>的方法就是：仔細聆聽腳步聲、時刻保持對<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">祂</span>的警戒，並盡可能與<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">祂</span>保持最遠的距離。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>玩得開心 ;)</strong></p>\n<h3><strong>模組常見問題：</strong></h3>\n<p>第一天/夜循環期間不會出現</p>\n<p>並非每晚都會現身</p>\n<h4><strong>歡迎在 YouTube 影片中使用此模組，僅請務必標示原作者。</strong></h4>\n<h3><strong>加入 Discord 伺服器！！！&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/3rDvamR5he\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/XcmjgRJPBG</a></strong></h3>\n<h3><strong>購買 The One Who Watches 周邊商品！ ---&gt; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixelcodershop.printful.me%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixelcodershop.printful.me/</a></strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp; <strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/940557/descr